---
// 模块 06「梦境实验室」：只展示本站真实测试。没有记录时不输出任何内容，也不放模拟数据。
interface Props {
  tests?: { id: string; airportName: string; testedOn: string; conditions: string; result: string }[];
}

const { tests = [] } = Astro.props;
---

{
  tests.length > 0 && (
    <section class="section wrap" aria-labelledby="lab-title">
      <div class="section__head">
        <div>
          <p class="section__kicker">梦境实验室</p>
          <h2 id="lab-title">本站实测记录</h2>
          <p class="section__sub">单次测试不代表长期稳定性，结果只适用于标注的时间和环境。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>品牌</th><th>日期</th><th>测试条件</th><th>结果</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {tests.map((test) => (
              <tr><td>{test.airportName}</td><td>{test.testedOn}</td><td>{test.conditions}</td><td>{test.result}</td></tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>
  )
}
